let table_5 = "[{\034why\034:\034words the text has once are the span, and the context is the text's: all of it on either side when there are fewer than 64 characters\034,\034text\034:\034The United States Congress passed the bill yesterday.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034United States\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:4,\034end\034:17,\034exact\034:\034United States\034,\034prefix\034:\034The \034,\034suffix\034:\034 Congress passed the bill yesterday.\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\034where the words are once, what the model says surrounds them is neither consulted nor kept\034,\034text\034:\034The United States Congress passed the bill yesterday.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034United States\034,\034prefix\034:\034In \034,\034suffix\034:\034 Senate\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:4,\034end\034:17,\034exact\034:\034United States\034,\034prefix\034:\034The \034,\034suffix\034:\034 Congress passed the bill yesterday.\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\034a span that begins the text has no prefix\034,\034text\034:\034Hello World\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034Hello\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:0,\034end\034:5,\034exact\034:\034Hello\034,\034suffix\034:\034 World\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\034a span that ends the text has no suffix\034,\034text\034:\034Hello World\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034World\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:6,\034end\034:11,\034exact\034:\034World\034,\034prefix\034:\034Hello \034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\03464 characters back from the span is the space before `The`, and 64 on from it is the space after `rent.`: the context is exactly 64 characters each way, with nothing to lengthen\034,\034text\034:\034Item 4. The treasurer reported a surplus for the third year running and the members agreed that the reserve should be raised to cover a full year of rent. Item 5 followed.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the members agreed\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:72,\034end\034:90,\034exact\034:\034the members agreed\034,\034prefix\034:\034The treasurer reported a surplus for the third year running and \034,\034suffix\034:\034 that the reserve should be raised to cover a full year of rent.\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\03464 characters back lands inside `room`: the prefix is lengthened back through the hyphen, which is no boundary, to the slash, which is one (72 characters); 64 on lands inside `noted`, and the suffix is lengthened to the semicolon (66)\034,\034text\034:\034Minutes: the committee met in the library/reading-room on Tuesday afternoon to consider the revised proposal, and the members agreed after a long discussion in which every objection was heard, noted; then the meeting closed.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the members agreed\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:114,\034end\034:132,\034exact\034:\034the members agreed\034,\034prefix\034:\034reading-room on Tuesday afternoon to consider the revised proposal, and \034,\034suffix\034:\034 after a long discussion in which every objection was heard, noted\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\03464 characters back and 64 on both land inside checksums with no boundary for 32 characters more: the lengthening stops there, and the context is 96 characters each way, beginning and ending inside a word\034,\034text\034:\034The archive e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855 was verified against the register, and the members agreed that the copy held in the vault under seal was 9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822cd15d6c15b0f00a08 too.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the members agreed\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:116,\034end\034:134,\034exact\034:\034the members agreed\034,\034prefix\034:\03498fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855 was verified against the register, and \034,\034suffix\034:\034 that the copy held in the vault under seal was 9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822c\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\034offsets count code points, not bytes and not what a reader sees as letters: before the span are an e with a combining acute accent (two code points), and two ideographs (one each, three bytes each)\034,\034text\034:\034Cafe\204\129 \228\184\150\231\149\140 opened in 1876.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034opened\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:9,\034end\034:15,\034exact\034:\034opened\034,\034prefix\034:\034Cafe\204\129 \228\184\150\231\149\140 \034,\034suffix\034:\034 in 1876.\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034unique-match\034}},{\034why\034:\034of three places, the model's prefix picks the second: only there does the text before end with it\034,\034text\034:\034Section A: the parties agree to terms. Section B: the parties agree to conditions. Section C: the parties agree to schedule.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034Section B: \034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:50,\034end\034:67,\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034Section A: the parties agree to terms. Section B: \034,\034suffix\034:\034 to conditions. Section C: the parties agree to schedule.\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034context-recovered\034}},{\034why\034:\034the model's suffix picks the third; its 64 characters of prefix would begin inside `to`, and are lengthened by one\034,\034text\034:\034Section A: the parties agree to terms. Section B: the parties agree to conditions. Section C: the parties agree to schedule.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034suffix\034:\034 to schedule\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:94,\034end\034:111,\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034to terms. Section B: the parties agree to conditions. Section C: \034,\034suffix\034:\034 to schedule.\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034context-recovered\034}},{\034why\034:\034a prefix given without the space that follows it does not end the text before any place, but it is among the 32 characters before the second, and that fits\034,\034text\034:\034Section A: the parties agree to terms. Section B: the parties agree to conditions. Section C: the parties agree to schedule.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034Section B:\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:50,\034end\034:67,\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034Section A: the parties agree to terms. Section B: \034,\034suffix\034:\034 to conditions. Section C: the parties agree to schedule.\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034context-recovered\034}},{\034why\034:\034a hint that fits every place picks the first of them, and the answer still says the context chose it\034,\034text\034:\034Section A: the parties agree to terms. Section B: the parties agree to conditions. Section C: the parties agree to schedule.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034: \034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:11,\034end\034:28,\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034Section A: \034,\034suffix\034:\034 to terms. Section B: the parties agree to conditions. Section C\034,\034anchorMethod\034:\034context-recovered\034}},{\034why\034:\034both hints must fit the one place: the prefix alone would pick the second and the suffix alone the third, no place has both, and the span falls back to the first\034,\034text\034:\034Section A: the parties agree to terms. Section B: the parties agree to conditions. Section C: the parties agree to schedule.\034,\034quoted\034:{\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034Section B: \034,\034suffix\034:\034 to schedule\034},\034reconciled\034:{\034start\034:11,\034end\034:28,\034exact\034:\034the parties agree\034,\034prefix\034:\034Section A: \034,\034suffix\034:\034 to terms. Sec